{"id":"b041170088bcba26","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbpersistency.md","title":"强持久性与线性roof证书","display":"df-pbpersistency — 强持久性与线性roof证书","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbpersistency","aliases":["27-df-pbpersistency"],"display":"df-pbpersistency — 强持久性与线性roof证书","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbroofrelax]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.1","source_printed_pages":"595","source_pdf_pages":"619","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbpersistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbpersistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbpersistency — 强持久性与线性roof证书"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"723fde838d821737\" href=\"?note=723fde838d821737\" title=\"27-df-pbroofrelax\">27-df-pbroofrelax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"619"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|&gt;2\\Rightarrow c_q(S)=0)\">\\(\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|&gt;2\\Rightarrow c_q(S)=0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_q,\\rho(q)\">\\(c_q,\\rho(q)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"723fde838d821737\" href=\"?note=723fde838d821737\" title=\"27-df-pbroofrelax\">27-df-pbroofrelax</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq[n]\">\\(I\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\)</span>。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}\">\\(\\mathrm{RoofWitness}\\)</span>；后者的证书内容限定为下式的顶点上界、最大值和系数条件，不另要求附带网络或多项式分解数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad L_\\ell(x)\\coloneqq\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell_ix_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_\\ell:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad L_\\ell(x)\\coloneqq\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell_ix_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(z)\\le f(x))\\Longrightarrow x|_I=a\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(z)\\le f(x))\\Longrightarrow x|_I=a\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(q,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(x)\\le L_\\ell(x)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max(\\ell_i,0)=\\rho(q)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(z)\\le q(x))\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\ell_i&gt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land(\\ell_i&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=0))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(q,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(x)\\le L_\\ell(x)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max(\\ell_i,0)=\\rho(q)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(z)\\le q(x))\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\ell_i&gt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land(\\ell_i&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_i=0))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强持久性要求所有全局最优解都满足固定值，区别于存在一个满足的弱版本。任意线性majorant不自动具有持久性；本证书显式包含该条件，避免凭上界系数擅自固定变量。RoofWitness定义为谓词，不假装唯一选择出某个线性函数。</p>\n<p>强持久性接口对任意实值f定义；只有RoofWitness的q和ρ需要二次次数限制。这一分离使一般固定变量推论不会调用超域的上游。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbroofrelax","status":"resolved","id":"723fde838d821737","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbroofrelax]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbroofrelax","status":"resolved","id":"723fde838d821737","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 满足 $\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_q(S)=0)$，$c_q,\\rho(q)$ 见 [[27-df-pbroofrelax]] 及其上游。$I\\subseteq[n]$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I$，$\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}$。引入 $\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}$ 与 $\\mathrm{RoofWitness}$；后者的证书内容限定为下式的顶点上界、最大值和系数条件，不另要求附带网络或多项式分解数据。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_q(S)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"c_q,\\rho(q)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\ell:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad L_\\ell(x)\\coloneqq\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell_ix_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(z)\\le f(x))\\Longrightarrow x|_I=a\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RoofWitness}(q,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(x)\\le L_\\ell(x)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\ell_0+\\sum_{i=1}^n\\max(\\ell_i,0)=\\rho(q)\\right)\n\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\n\\left((\\forall z\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;q(z)\\le q(x))\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\ell_i>0\\Rightarrow x_i=1)\\land(\\ell_i<0\\Rightarrow x_i=0))\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpersistency|df-pbpersistency — 强持久性与线性roof证书]]"},{"id":"bc852fdef9f33c3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$，$I\\subseteq[n]$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^I$，且$\\mathrm{StrongPersistent}(f,I,a)$，见 [[27-df-pbpersistency]]。"},{"id":"dd853b7af4d47abc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 满足 $\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;(|S|>2\\Rightarrow c_f(S)=0)$；$c_f,\\rho(f)$ 沿 [[27-df-pbpersistency]] 的书内依赖取得。$\\mathrm{RoofWitness}$ 仅取该定义中给定的证书谓词。$\\ell^f$ 由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["723fde838d821737"]}